      "description": "<p>20 feet.</p>\n<p>The nightmare continually exhales black smoke. Creatures within the aura are Concealed to those outside it, and creatures outside the aura are concealed to creatures within it. Nightmares and their riders can see through this smoke.</p>\n<p>A creature that begins its turn in the area must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:28|traits:inhaled,poison] save or be Sickened 2. It's then temporarily immune to being sickened by the smoke for 1 minute. This is an inhaled poison, and the nightmare and its rider are immune to it.</p>",
